    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Sub-Section (3) of Section 3 of the Ports and Airports Development Levy Act, No. 18 of 2011, I, Anura Kumara Dissanayake, Minister of Finance, Planning and Economic Development, do hereby amend the Order published in Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2312/67 dated December 31, 2022, as last amended by Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2461/44 dated November 07, 2025, as follows: \u00b7",
